#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"xx-method\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"xx-method\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Transpiler stage and plugin options {#transpiler-stage-and-plugin-options}"
msgstr ""
"Mga opsyon sa yugto at plugin ng Transpiler {#transpiler-stage-and-plugin-"
"options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These options are suffixed with `_method`. They influence how the transpiler"
" works and are used to try and get better, different, or specific output "
"from the transpiler.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga opsyong ito ay may suffix na `_method`. Naaapektuhan nila kung paano"
" gumagana ang transpiler at ginagamit upang subukang makakuha ng mas "
"maganda, iba, o tiyak na output mula sa transpiler.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`init_method` (str) - The plugin to use for the initialization stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`init_method` (str) - Ang plugin na gagamitin para sa yugto ng "
"initialization.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`layout_method` (str) - The layout selection pass (`trivial`, `dense`, "
"`sabre`). This can also be the external plugin name to use for the layout "
"stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`layout_method` (str) - Ang layout selection pass (`trivial`, `dense`, "
"`sabre`). Maaari din itong maging pangalan ng external plugin na gagamitin "
"para sa yugto ng layout.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`optimization_method` (str) - The plugin to use for the optimization "
"stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`optimization_method` (str) - Ang plugin na gagamitin para sa yugto ng "
"optimization.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`routing_method` (str) - Name of routing pass (`basic`, `lookahead`, "
"`default`, `sabre`, `none`). This can also be the external plugin name to "
"use for the routing stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`routing_method` (str) - Pangalan ng routing pass (`basic`, `lookahead`, "
"`default`, `sabre`, `none`). Maaari din itong maging pangalan ng external "
"plugin na gagamitin para sa yugto ng routing.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`scheduling_method` (str) - Name of scheduling pass. This can also be the "
"external plugin name to use for the scheduling stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`scheduling_method` (str) - Pangalan ng scheduling pass. Maaari din itong "
"maging pangalan ng external plugin na gagamitin para sa yugto ng "
"scheduling.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`as_soon_as_possible`: Schedule instructions greedily: as early as possible "
"on a qubit resource (alias: `asap`).\n"
msgstr ""
"`as_soon_as_possible`: Mag-schedule ng mga instruksyon nang mabilis: nang "
"maaga hangga't maaari sa isang qubit resource (alias: `asap`).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`as_late_as_possible`: Schedule instructions late.  That is, keep qubits in "
"the ground state when possible (alias: `alap`).\n"
msgstr ""
"`as_late_as_possible`: Mag-schedule ng mga instruksyon nang huli. Ibig "
"sabihin, panatilihing nasa ground state ang mga qubit kung maaari (alias: "
"`alap`).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`translation_method` (str) - Name of translation pass (`unroller`, "
"`translator`, `synthesis`). This can also be the external plugin name to use"
" for the translation stage.\n"
msgstr ""
"`translation_method` (str) - Pangalan ng translation pass (`unroller`, "
"`translator`, `synthesis`). Maaari din itong maging pangalan ng external "
"plugin na gagamitin para sa yugto ng translation.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`unitary_synthesis_method` (str) - The name of the unitary synthesis method "
"to use. By default `default` is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"`unitary_synthesis_method` (str) - Ang pangalan ng unitary synthesis method "
"na gagamitin. Bilang default, ginagamit ang `default`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  To see a list of all installed plugins for a given stage, run [`list_stage_plugins(\"stage_name\")`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins). For example, if you want to see a list of all installed plugins for the routing stage, run `list_stage_plugins(routing)`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Upang makita ang listahan ng lahat ng naka-install na plugin para sa isang partikular na yugto, patakbuhin ang [`list_stage_plugins(\"stage_name\")`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins). Halimbawa, kung gusto mong makita ang listahan ng lahat ng naka-install na plugin para sa yugto ng routing, patakbuhin ang `list_stage_plugins(routing)`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

